    "updated_at": "2021-06-15T21:39:28Z",
    "body": "> Just checking, we don't want to support this for ImageBitmapRenderingContext, right?\r\n\r\nThis is a lot more relevant for 2d contexts. This feature was motivated by demands from our users. I can see it being useful for webGL contexts (through `readPixels`), but the performance cost for CPU rendering is probably too high to make this worthwhile. For now (and likely forever) we're just aiming for 2d contexts.",
