    "body": "> Reading the issue again it seems that @litherum asked for numbers and @fserb said he was going to provide them. Can those be linked in that issue?\r\n\r\nOur intern did a presentation on this last summer:\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1f-A9u7GslPqQYq7CVw_uSFQjmA8gCBJ0a9Dcm-7BMqY/edit?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nFor certain use cases this is a night-and-day improvement. It's also worth pointing out that it removes the surprising result of decelerating an accelerated canvas upon first readback in our implementation. This causes things like gradients and anti-aliasing to change, not to mention performance degradations. We've seen dozens of bugs filed concerning this in the past few years.",
